.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/per-iter-commit-subject-scope.md:30:Confirmed option 1, `chore(session): record <loop> iter{n} memory` — the `session` scope matches the directory being committed; the loop name goes in the subject body.
