+- Project-level note exists at `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/notes/2026-05-23-workflow-phase-doc-set-enumeration.md`.
+- Note frontmatter has `type: notes`, `scope: project`, `feature: null`, and `features_touched: [git-workflow]`.
